139b4-1ae3-4889-a4b4-8276d4b82a94\" />\n\n### Steps to reproduce\n\n1. Import a CSV file.\n2. Open the file in the import dock and select **Import as** > **Keep file**\n3. Reimport\n\nResult:\nThe file behaves as expected but displays with an error icon in the file system dock.\n\n### Minimal reproduction project (MRP)\n\nN/A","closed_by":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/113468/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"timeline_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/113468/timeline","performed_via_github_app":null,"state_reason":null,"pinned_comment":null}